 .SH DESCRIPTION
 nsxiv is a simple image viewer for X.
@@ -156,6 +158,40 @@ only the final one takes effect.
 Update the thumbnail cache (creating them if necessary) of the given arguments
 and exit. Can be used along with
 .BR "\-\-clean\-cache" .
+.TP
+.B "\-\-bg\-center"
+Set the first given image (see
+.BR \-n )
+as the X root window background, centered on the screen, and exit without
+opening a window.
+Mirrors the option of the same name in feh.
+.TP
+.B "\-\-bg\-fill"
+Like
+.BR \-\-bg\-center ,
+but scale the image to cover the whole screen, preserving its aspect ratio and
+cropping whatever overflows.
+.TP
+.B "\-\-bg\-max"
+Like
+.BR \-\-bg\-center ,
+but scale the image to the largest size that fits on the screen, preserving its
+aspect ratio. Unused screen area is filled with black.
+.TP
+.B "\-\-bg\-scale"
+Like
+.BR \-\-bg\-center ,
+but stretch the image to exactly the screen size, ignoring its aspect ratio.
+.TP
+.B "\-\-bg\-tile"
+Like
+.BR \-\-bg\-center ,
+but tile the image across the screen at its original size.
+.TP
+.B "\-\-no\-bgscript"
+Do not write the wallpaper restore script (see
+.BR WALLPAPER )
+when setting a wallpaper.
